    ("What really astonished the research team ______ the sheer speed of the chemical reaction.", ["were", "was", "are", "had been"], 1, "Vytýkací věta (Cleft sentence): shoda s podmětem za slovesem 'be' ('the sheer speed' = jednotné číslo ➔ 'was').", "What amazed me WAS [podstatné jméno j. č.]."),
